{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "About": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Acerca de"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About Room in the Cart": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About Room in the Cart"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Acerca de Room in the Cart"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a date to check food quality or look up a food in the offline storage guide. A reminder can ask you to open My Pantry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a date to check food quality or look up a food in the offline storage guide. A reminder can ask you to open My Pantry."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elige una fecha para revisar la calidad de un alimento o búscalo en la guía de conservación sin conexión. Puedes recibir un recordatorio para abrir Mi despensa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If Apple requires an age range and the regional check is enabled, the app asks whether you’ll share it. The app uses the response on this iPhone to decide whether to open your workspace. It keeps the check result in memory and sends no age range to your household.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If Apple requires an age range and the regional check is enabled, the app asks whether you’ll share it. The app uses the response on this iPhone to decide whether to open your workspace. It keeps the check result in memory and sends no age range to your household."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si Apple requiere un rango de edad y la comprobación regional está activada, la app te pregunta si quieres compartirlo. La app usa la respuesta en este iPhone para decidir si abre tu espacio de trabajo. Mantiene el resultado de la comprobación en memoria y no envía el rango de edad a tu hogar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If Apple tells Room in the Cart that a guardian withdrew permission for an App Store download, the service saves a receipt to recognize repeated notices. The receipt contains the notice ID, the time Apple signed it and whether it came from the live or test App Store. It contains no age range, download ID or household account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If Apple tells Room in the Cart that a guardian withdrew permission for an App Store download, the service saves a receipt to recognize repeated notices. The receipt contains the notice ID, the time Apple signed it and whether it came from the live or test App Store. It contains no age range, download ID or household account."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si Apple avisa a Room in the Cart de que un tutor retiró el permiso para descargar la app del App Store, el servicio guarda un comprobante para reconocer los avisos repetidos. El comprobante contiene el identificador del aviso, la hora en que Apple lo firmó y si procede del App Store o de su entorno de pruebas. No contiene el rango de edad ni identifica la descarga o la cuenta del hogar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Shop, choose Add a grocery to start your private list. Pantry, Dinners and Records are also available without an account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Shop, choose Add a grocery to start your private list. Pantry, Dinners and Records are also available without an account."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En Compras, elige Agregar un producto para comenzar tu lista privada. También puedes usar Despensa, Cenas e Historial sin una cuenta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Shop, choose Add a grocery. Enter the item and any amount you know. You can also review pasted text and check possible duplicates before adding them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Shop, choose Add a grocery. Enter the item and any amount you know. You can also review pasted text and check possible duplicates before adding them."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En Compras, elige Agregar un producto. Ingresa el producto y la cantidad si la sabes. También puedes revisar el texto que pegaste y comprobar si hay duplicados antes de agregar los productos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Pantry to see the food you have and where you keep it. Add food by hand or review the lines from a receipt. Check each amount before saving.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Pantry to see the food you have and where you keep it. Add food by hand or review the lines from a receipt. Check each amount before saving."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre Despensa para ver qué alimentos tienes y dónde los guardas. Agrega alimentos manualmente o revisa las líneas de un recibo. Comprueba las cantidades antes de guardar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pale pear rests behind the rim of a plum cart with two wheels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A pale pear rests behind the rim of a plum cart with two wheels."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una pera de color claro asoma sobre el borde de un carrito color ciruela con dos ruedas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View cart illustration": {
      "localizations": {
