          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose your email app and review the message before sending. No message is sent automatically.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose your email app and review the message before sending. No message is sent automatically."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elige tu app de correo y revisa el mensaje antes de enviarlo. No se envía ningún mensaje automáticamente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Operator": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Operator"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Operador"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ordinary dictation and photo text recognition run on this iPhone. Your private evidence photos are saved in protected local storage. Apple may retrieve a selected iCloud photo. You can include reviewed photos in an encrypted recovery file.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordinary dictation and photo text recognition run on this iPhone. Your private evidence photos are saved in protected local storage. Apple may retrieve a selected iCloud photo. You can include reviewed photos in an encrypted recovery file."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El dictado habitual y el reconocimiento de texto en fotos se realizan en este iPhone. Tus fotos privadas de referencia se guardan en el almacenamiento protegido del dispositivo. Apple puede descargar una foto que elijas de iCloud. Puedes incluir las fotos revisadas en un archivo de recuperación cifrado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The household service counts online assistance requests for your account to enforce the daily limit. It also keeps a code for each request to prevent processing it twice. The service can remove these records once they are more than 24 hours old.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The household service counts online assistance requests for your account to enforce the daily limit. It also keeps a code for each request to prevent processing it twice. The service can remove these records once they are more than 24 hours old."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El servicio del hogar cuenta las solicitudes de asistencia en línea de tu cuenta para aplicar el límite diario. También guarda un código por solicitud para evitar procesarla dos veces. El servicio puede eliminar estos registros una vez que hayan pasado 24 horas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When online assistance is available, an authorized adult can review and send a selected excerpt, a cropped image or a separate voice recording to OpenAI through Room in the Cart. Listen to the recording or inspect the crop before sending. You can keep using the local editor.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When online assistance is available, an authorized adult can review and send a selected excerpt, a cropped image or a separate voice recording to OpenAI through Room in the Cart. Listen to the recording or inspect the crop before sending. You can keep using the local editor."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuando la asistencia en línea está disponible, un adulto autorizado puede revisar y enviar un fragmento de texto, una imagen recortada o una grabación de voz independiente a OpenAI a través de Room in the Cart. Escucha la grabación o revisa el recorte antes de enviarlo. También puedes seguir usando el editor local."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use soon will use the start of this range unless you have chosen a manual check date.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use soon will use the start of this range unless you have chosen a manual check date."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usar pronto tomará el inicio de este intervalo, salvo que hayas elegido una fecha de revisión manual."
          }
        }
      }
    },
