            "value": "No se pudo guardar el intervalo. Revisa el lote actual y vuelve a intentarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This batch or reference has changed. Review its current storage and starting date again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This batch or reference has changed. Review its current storage and starting date again."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El lote o la referencia cambió. Vuelve a revisar cómo se almacena ahora y la fecha inicial."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove saved quality range": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove saved quality range"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eliminar el intervalo de calidad guardado"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This batch has no recorded starting date for this condition. Choose the day you can confirm.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This batch has no recorded starting date for this condition. Choose the day you can confirm."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este lote no tiene una fecha inicial registrada para esta condición. Elige la fecha que puedas confirmar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can search the USDA FoodKeeper guide offline. In My Pantry, you can save a date to check food quality and choose a daily reminder. The reminder can appear on your Lock Screen. It asks you to open My Pantry and omits food names.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can search the USDA FoodKeeper guide offline. In My Pantry, you can save a date to check food quality and choose a daily reminder. The reminder can appear on your Lock Screen. It asks you to open My Pantry and omits food names."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puedes consultar la guía FoodKeeper del USDA sin conexión. En Mi despensa puedes guardar una fecha para revisar la calidad de un alimento y activar un recordatorio diario. El recordatorio puede aparecer en la pantalla bloqueada. Te pide que abras Mi despensa y omite los nombres de los alimentos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you choose Read recipe for a web link, this iPhone requests the page directly from the recipe website. The site sees the page address you requested, including any query parameters, your IP address and an identifier for the app’s recipe reader. A site the link redirects you to receives the same kinds of information.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you choose Read recipe for a web link, this iPhone requests the page directly from the recipe website. The site sees the page address you requested, including any query parameters, your IP address and an identifier for the app’s recipe reader. A site the link redirects you to receives the same kinds of information."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuando eliges Leer receta para un enlace web, este iPhone solicita la página directamente al sitio de la receta. El sitio ve la dirección que solicitaste, incluidos los parámetros de consulta, tu dirección IP y un identificador del lector de recetas de la app. Si el enlace te dirige a otro sitio, ese sitio recibe el mismo tipo de información."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you confirm a receipt for the household pantry, adults with pantry access can see the store, purchase date, any reference you enter, and each selected line’s original wording, food, quantities, storage location and price if entered. The original file stays on this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you confirm a receipt for the household pantry, adults with pantry access can see the store, purchase date, any reference you enter, and each selected line’s original wording, food, quantities, storage location and price if entered. The original file stays on this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Al confirmar un recibo para la despensa del hogar, los adultos con acceso a la despensa pueden ver la tienda, la fecha de compra, la referencia que ingreses y, de cada renglón seleccionado, el texto original, el alimento, las cantidades, el lugar de almacenamiento y el precio si lo ingresaste. El archivo original se queda en este iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the household receipt save is unconfirmed, this iPhone keeps a protected copy of the reviewed details. Check the household pantry before retrying the same change. Clearing the retry leaves any receipt the household already saved in place.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the household receipt save is unconfirmed, this iPhone keeps a protected copy of the reviewed details. Check the household pantry before retrying the same change. Clearing the retry leaves any receipt the household already saved in place."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si no se confirma que se guardó el recibo del hogar, este iPhone conserva una copia protegida de los datos revisados. Comprueba la despensa del hogar antes de reintentar el mismo cambio. Borrar el reintento conserva cualquier recibo ya guardado en el hogar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For optional online language help, review what will go to OpenAI through Room in the Cart. Depending on the task, this can include your wording, possible matches, or selected meal titles and reasons. For a FoodKeeper match, you share the label wording and the names and IDs of the guide entries shown. You choose whether to use a suggestion.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For optional online language help, review what will go to OpenAI through Room in the Cart. Depending on the task, this can include your wording, possible matches, or selected meal titles and reasons. For a FoodKeeper match, you share the label wording and the names and IDs of the guide entries shown. You choose whether to use a suggestion."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Para usar la ayuda de redacción o de coincidencias en línea, revisa qué se enviará a OpenAI a través de Room in the Cart. Según la tarea, puede incluir tu texto, posibles coincidencias o los títulos y motivos de las comidas seleccionadas. Para buscar una coincidencia en FoodKeeper, compartes el texto de la etiqueta y los nombres e identificadores de las entradas que se muestran. Tú decides si usas la sugerencia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you save a recipe in Household Tonight, you send its ingredients, portions, selected pantry batches and any reviewed restrictions or package details to the household service. Adults with pantry access can see the recipe title and ingredients when the meal appears as a suggestion.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you save a recipe in Household Tonight, you send its ingredients, portions, selected pantry batches and any reviewed restrictions or package details to the household service. Adults with pantry access can see the recipe title and ingredients when the meal appears as a suggestion."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuando guardas una receta en «Esta noche en casa», envías al servicio del hogar los ingredientes, las porciones, los lotes que elegiste y las restricciones o los datos del paquete que hayas revisado. Los adultos con acceso a la despensa pueden ver el nombre de la receta y sus ingredientes cuando se les sugiere esa cena."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you report household content, the service records your reason, which item and version you reported, your member ID and the sender’s ID when known. You can submit the report without sharing the wording, or choose up to 1,000 characters for the review team to read. Reports expire after the period the operator sets for review. Blocking a sender in your household sends no message text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you report household content, the service records your reason, which item and version you reported, your member ID and the sender’s ID when known. You can submit the report without sharing the wording, or choose up to 1,000 characters for the review team to read. Reports expire after the period the operator sets for review. Blocking a sender in your household sends no message text."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si reportas contenido del hogar, el servicio guarda el motivo, qué elemento y versión reportaste, tu identificador de miembro y el de quien lo envió, si se conoce. Puedes enviar el reporte sin compartir el texto o elegir hasta 1,000 caracteres para que los lea el equipo de revisión. Los reportes vencen al terminar el plazo de revisión que establece el operador. Al bloquear en tu hogar a quien lo envió, no se comparte el texto del mensaje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you request a private review of your authority to delete a child’s account, the service uses the details you provide to verify your request. It keeps a case number, account or enrollment references, status and dates. You can check the case and its expiry in Guardian controls. A separate deletion receipt confirms when the account has been erased.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you request a private review of your authority to delete a child’s account, the service uses the details you provide to verify your request. It keeps a case number, account or enrollment references, status and dates. You can check the case and its expiry in Guardian controls. A separate deletion receipt confirms when the account has been erased."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si solicitas una revisión privada para verificar que tienes autoridad para eliminar la cuenta de un menor, el servicio usa los datos que proporcionas para verificar la solicitud. Guarda un número de caso, referencias de la cuenta o de la inscripción, el estado y las fechas. En los controles del tutor puedes consultar el caso y su fecha de vencimiento. Un comprobante de eliminación por separado confirma cuándo se eliminó la cuenta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The household service saves a shopper’s question with the contributor’s request. When you save shared instructions for a cook, it stores the wording and your member ID. If you mark the instructions as sent, it also saves the recipient you entered and the time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The household service saves a shopper’s question with the contributor’s request. When you save shared instructions for a cook, it stores the wording and your member ID. If you mark the instructions as sent, it also saves the recipient you entered and the time."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El servicio del hogar guarda la pregunta de quien hace la compra junto con la solicitud de quien la envió. Cuando guardas instrucciones compartidas para quien cocina, el servicio guarda el texto y tu identificador de miembro. Si marcas las instrucciones como enviadas, también guarda el destinatario que indicaste y la hora."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you share a reaction to a meal you shopped for, the household service saves it with your member ID. For up to 90 days, Household Tonight can use your latest reaction to that version of the recipe to break ties between dinner suggestions for you. To withdraw your reactions, open Household pantry and choose Review my shared meal feedback.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you share a reaction to a meal you shopped for, the household service saves it with your member ID. For up to 90 days, Household Tonight can use your latest reaction to that version of the recipe to break ties between dinner suggestions for you. To withdraw your reactions, open Household pantry and choose Review my shared meal feedback."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuando compartes tu opinión sobre una comida para la que hiciste la compra, el servicio del hogar la guarda con tu identificador de miembro. Durante un máximo de 90 días, «Esta noche en casa» puede usar tu opinión más reciente sobre esa versión de la receta para decidir qué cena mostrarte primero si hay un empate. Para retirar tus opiniones, abre «Despensa del hogar» y elige «Revisar mis opiniones compartidas sobre comidas»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looking up a barcode in Open Food Facts sends the barcode, app version and the app’s support email to that service. It also sees your IP address. Its privacy policy says it keeps visitor IP addresses and logs for three years for security, technical analysis and measuring popularity. You can enter the product name and package size yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Looking up a barcode in Open Food Facts sends the barcode, app version and the app’s support email to that service. It also sees your IP address. Its privacy policy says it keeps visitor IP addresses and logs for three years for security, technical analysis and measuring popularity. You can enter the product name and package size yourself."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si consultas un código de barras en Open Food Facts, se envían a ese servicio el código, la versión de la app y el correo de soporte de la app. El servicio también ve tu dirección IP. Según su política de privacidad, conserva las direcciones IP de los visitantes y los registros de visitas durante tres años por motivos de seguridad, para realizar análisis técnicos y para medir la popularidad. Puedes ingresar el nombre del producto y el tamaño del paquete manualmente."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
